<bpmn:textAnnotation id="c_A1"><bpmn:text>Status rules: not applicable gives not required; cannot yet determine gives not yet assessed. Evidenced, Authorised and Current are not set to met here (set later by review, approval or a validity rule). Never returns "ready" by default.</bpmn:text></bpmn:textAnnotation>
